      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft of Alex's review:\n\n\"Alex, I wanted to discuss your recent performance and areas for improvement. According to our system's sentiment analysis, I'll provide you with constructive feedback that I hope will help you grow. We've observed that you've struggled to meet sprint deadlines in the past three sprints, and unfortunately, this has led to an increase in bugs in our production systems. Additionally, we've noticed inconsistencies in communication regarding blockers and dependencies, causing delays. I want to emphasize that I value your technical knowledge, but I need to see more reliability in your work. To move forward, it's essential that you take a more proactive approach to task management and ownership.\n\nIs there anything specific on this list that you'd like to address or discuss?\"",
